// Honeynet IOC ──(STIX 2.1 Format)──> MISP Threat Platform ──> Perimeter Firewalls Auto-Block Table`},{id:30,question:"Synthesize the overarching strategic value of Honeynets in enterprise and national cyber resilience.",shortAnswer:"Honeynets provide the ultimate controlled laboratory for cyber warfare: they trap adversaries inside synthetic enterprise ecosystems, eliminate SOC alert fatigue with 100% True-Positive early warning, reverse the attacker's asymmetric advantage, and harvest zero-day threat intelligence in compliance with CERT-In and the DPDP Act 2023.",explanation:"By combining multi-node realism, strict Honeywall data control, eBPF out-of-band kernel tracing, and automated threat feed ingestion, Honeynets empower security teams to study real-world adversary TTPs without risking production downtime.",hint:"Honeynets turn defense into an active science, trapping hackers and studying their secrets safely.",level:"Moderate",codeExample:`// The Master Honeynet Cyber Defense Formula:
